  title: "Reclam\u0103 interceptat\u0103"
  body: "HALDEN CLOUD: via\u021Ba ta, salvat\u0103 pentru totdeauna. Abonamentul
    gratuit include, implicit, consim\u021B\u0103m\xE2ntul pentru analiza comportamental\u0103.
    Dezabonarea se face personal, la sediul central, \xEEntre orele 03:00 \u0219i
    03:05."
  titleEn: Intercepted advert
  bodyEn: 'HALDEN CLOUD: your life, saved forever. The free plan includes, by default,
    consent to behavioural analysis. To unsubscribe, come in person to our headquarters
    between 03:00 and 03:05.'
